Buttons
-------

There are 3 buttons on the back side:  Power on/off, BOOT and RESET.

.. rst-class:: text-center

  |btn_img|

  *Buttons*

What every button does:

- GPIO1: connected to ESP32P4 GPIO1, press to set low. In the factory firmware, this button is programmed to wake/sleep the product.
- BOOT: hold it while powering on to enter firmware download mode
- RESET: ESP32P4 reset signal

